    "description": "Acclaimed underground filmmaker Pete Anderson delivers this compelling psychological story of Wade, a twisted video voyeur with a dark secret. His sad story unfolds as he creeps from window to window searching for his victims. When he meets Angela, his demented reality is fully uncovered. His complex layers are exposed leading to the shocking climax with poignant statements about the society we live in. What is he searching for? Who is he looking for? You're Being watched.... Do You Know Why?",
